# Firmware & Hardware Healing — Mesh-Wide Pattern

## The Left Eye Problem (iGPU + dGPU dual display)

Any AMD gate with both iGPU and dGPU may hit this:
- CSM enabled → hides NB Configuration → iGPU disabled → no UMA → left eye blind
- Fix: CSM OFF + UMA allocated + Integrated Graphics = Force

