|------|-----|-------|------|------|------------|
| northGate | 9950X3D | ASUS X870E-E | AMI v1401 | RDNA 2 (2 CU) | LOCKED (CSM=1) |
| eastGate | (check) | (check) | (check) | (check) | UNKNOWN |
