## Attenuator Pattern (dual display wake)
- RIGHT EYE (dGPU): wakes naturally at POST, primary display
- LEFT EYE (iGPU): needs wake pulse — `displayswitch /extend` + DDC/CI + PnP enable
- Attenuator scheduled task: GaiaLeftEyeWake (runs on login)

## CSM — The Root Cause
CSM (Compatibility Support Module) enables legacy BIOS boot.
On ASUS boards: CSM=ON → iGPU disabled, NB Config hidden, Re-Size BAR disabled.
ALWAYS disable CSM on UEFI-only systems. Windows 11 requires UEFI anyway.

## Secure Boot
Secure Boot = True on northGate. This may block unsigned EFI tools (modGRUBShell).
Smokeless_UMAF may also be blocked. If both fail → manual BIOS is the fallback.
